              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": 1100,
              "content": "A bank connected before wimm could read transactions is live and narrow, not broken. The member starts from the notice on Transactions, drawn in 03-transactions as J07.B / 02, confirms once more at the bank, and comes back to a ledger that now includes it. The picker and the account chooser are both skipped: nothing about ownership changes.",
